meta {
  name: List Playable Movies
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?region={{region}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  region: {{region}}
}

docs {
  # List Playable Movies

  Returns all playable content entries stored in the `playable_content` table, optionally filtered by availability in a specific ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code.

  ## Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `region` | `string` | No | — | ISO country code (e.g., `US`, `MX`, `ES`). If omitted, returns all records. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: Array of playable content objects (`tmdbId`, `muxPlaybackId`, `muxAssetId`, `availableRegions`).
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

